  "toolHint": "{id, select, rectangle_select{Drag to select a rectangle. Shift makes a square.} move_selected_pixels{Drag the selection to move it: the right button turns it, the handles scale it. Ctrl leaves a copy, the arrow keys nudge.} lasso_select{Drag to draw the outline of a selection.} move_selection{Drag the selection outline. The pixels stay.} ellipse_select{Drag to select an ellipse. Shift makes a circle.} zoom{Left click zooms in, right click zooms out, a drawn box zooms to it.} magic_wand{Click to select an area of similar colour. Shift selects over the whole image.} pan{Drag to move the view.} paint_bucket{Left click fills with the primary colour, right click with the secondary.} gradient{Drag to draw a gradient. The handles change it, Enter finishes.} paintbrush{The left button paints with the primary colour, the right with the secondary.} eraser{Drag to erase to transparency.} pencil{Draws one-pixel lines without antialiasing.} color_picker{Left click picks the primary colour, right click the secondary.} clone_stamp{Ctrl+click sets the source, then drag to paint from it.} recolor{Replaces the secondary colour with the primary where you paint. Ctrl+click picks.} text{Click to place the cursor, then type. The right button or the handle moves the text, Esc finishes.} line_curve{Drag to draw a line. The handles bend it, Enter finishes.} rectangle{Drag to draw a rectangle. Shift makes a square.} rounded_rectangle{Drag to draw a rounded rectangle. Shift makes a square.} ellipse{Drag to draw an ellipse. Shift makes a circle.} freeform_shape{Drag to draw a closed freeform shape.} other{}}",
